<title>USA: Daleco funds development efforts.</title>
<headline>Daleco funds development efforts.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daleco Resources Corp said Thursday it signed a financing agreement which will provide up to $15 million for the exploitation activities of its subsidiary, Westlands Resources Corp, along the Austin Chalk trend in Texas.</p>
<p>&quot;While the funding is subject to the preparation and execution of final documents, no apparent obstacles are foreseen,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Of the $15 million available to the company, approximately $11 million has been earmarked specifically for drilling 22 horizontal drilling prospects and various other developmental projects on Daleco's 7,300 acre leasehold along the Austin Chalk trend,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
